# Markdown files (Ignore all md files, preserve README.md, promote.md, SEO_AUDIT.md & PRODUCT_HUNT.md)
*.md
**/*.md
!README.md
!promote.md
!SEO_AUDIT.md
!PRODUCT_HUNT.md

